2005-11-21 09:11  acdalton

	* DungeonMaker.cpp, DungeonMaker.h, Makefile, Makefile.bsd,
	  VERSION, main.cpp: - merged changes from forked project which
	  include:   - creation of generate() method in DungeonMaker object
	  which abstracts the previous main.cpp   - no longer requiring
	  that design data be read from files; one can pass a string to the
	  new AcceptDesign() method (ReadDesign still works as it used to)
	  - added accessors GetRooms(), GetMOBInfo(), and GetTreasInfo()
	  for help with customized plonking   - some minor changes to make
	  gcc happy - Makefile has been altered to not include the SDL
	  material (although all that is still available in the interactive
	  subdirectory) - Makefile.bsd is now available to make building
	  shared libraries on such systems easier

